{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261026/photo/bkn-20261026200014260-1026_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261026131638\"/><p>殲15紅藍對抗訓練最新畫面曝光。</p><p>中國海軍航空大學某部近日開展多課目跨晝夜飛行訓練，檢驗了飛行員生理心理水平和戰術能力。殲15紅藍對抗訓練最新畫面曝光。</p><p>隨着塔台指揮員一聲令下，海軍航空大學某部數架戰機升空，展開一場多課目跨晝夜飛行訓練。訓練內容包括，「一對二」空戰對抗，紅藍雙方互相交換進攻位置，參與訓練的戰機最終完成任務。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:40:59.106977+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T12:00:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T14:58:43.185954+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T12:38:15.996801+00:00","content_hash":"8768373947c31401f9a5c4988f6e28f18ba47c0158c88ba34edb60415e89a551","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:40:59.106977+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}